{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33369","headline":"寄岳阳严使君 · 袁皓","name":"寄岳阳严使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得意东归过岳阳，桂枝香惹蘂珠香。\n也知暮雨生巫峡，争奈朝云属楚王。\n万恨只凭期尅手，寸心唯系别离肠。\n南亭宴罢笙歌散，回首烟波路渺茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}